  "body": "Positioned in a highly sought-after coastal community on the North Shore, this well-located parcel of land presents an exciting opportunity for developers, builders and investors looking to secure a site with strong future potential.\r\n\r\nWith Resource Consent already granted, much of the groundwork has been completed, providing a clear pathway for the next stage of the development. This is an excellent opportunity to secure a consented site and bring your own vision to life in a growing and desirable market.\r\n\r\nBeyond its development potential, the location offers an appealing lifestyle with easy access to beautiful beaches, coastal walks, local cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Silverdale's major retail and commercial facilities are also within easy reach, while convenient access to State Highway 1 provides excellent connections towards Auckland and the wider North Shore.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by established homes, greenery and a relaxed coastal atmosphere, this is a rare opportunity to secure consented land in a highly desirable Orewa location.",
